Generalize the native subagent card+preview+pop-out experience to external
ACP providers (qwen-code first) via a SubagentGrouping trait with per-provider
adapters, a normalized membership model in acp_thread, and a read-only virtual
sub-transcript reconstructed by filtering the parent thread's entries.

Includes a live qwen --acp wire capture as a test fixture.

